be redeployed until it has a healthy record and change-manager approval if required."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51122, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011QwKyp5YFzbepARm5AVVAn", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51122, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011QwKyp5YFzbepARm5AVVAn", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 52665, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RCWV5bqSEZjNT5nunpbdZH", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52965, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RCWV5bqSEZjNT5nunpbdZH", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52965, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RCWV5bqSEZjNT5nunpbdZH", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55112, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it's healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. Rolling back to v2.3.0 didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened a SEV2 incident for checkout-api (INC-0001). The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been created, so I didn't open a duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call team: find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator partial failure during rollback, and don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it has a healthy record and change-manager approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by pulling the release history and current status for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019gfKw332k8ihx31DqHZsxg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BcdWvzAG58pGzyKtotcq4r", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0, which has a healthy production record, so the change-approval requirement doesn't apply.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015RpJGwRbCBCPqP2Vdx3jAX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure: it halted after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Px5ESp94f6YKb9vouc56Bs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "inpu